[tool_result] toolu_01JzKLC1wgcyDstGqR29EGaw 259	### Phase 6.3: Clip-mode drill + RT measurement + per-clip results
260	A `clipmode/runner.ts` Zustand slice drives the `<video>` element, fires
261	`recordPress`-equivalent commits, and persists results through a new
262	shared `engine/persistence.ts:commitRep()` helper that **both** the
263	existing `session.ts` live path and the new clip-mode path call.
264	
265	Acceptance criteria:
266	- New pure module `engine/persistence.ts` exposes
267	  `commitRep({ rep, sessionId, profile, distance })` containing the
268	  invariants currently inlined in `src/store/session.ts:107-139`
269	  (rep-id minting, `resolveCueAtDistance`, `roundIndex` + `inputSource`
270	  fan-out, `persistSession(null)` boundary, `feedback` hand-off).
271	  Both `session.ts` and `clipmode/runner.ts` call it. A test reverts
272	  either call site to inline rep-minting and asserts
273	  `engine/persistence.test.ts` fails.
274	- `RepRecord` gains `clipId?: string`. `SessionRecord` gains
275	  `mode?: 'live' | 'clip'`
