- New `clipmode/runtime.ts` (`isClipModeSupported`), `clipmode/random.ts` (`pickNextClip` uniform no-immediate-repeat), `clipmode/runner.ts` (Zustand drill slice), `ui/ClipDrillScreen.tsx` (rvfc-driven `<video>` playback). `IdleScreen` gains the `mode-segmented` radio control + `clip-mode-unsupported` / `clip-mode-no-clips` banners. `SummaryScreen` gains an optional `mode='clip'` branch with per-clip cue breakdown.
- 271/271 vitest tests pass (was 238; +33 new). Lint, tsc, build all clean. Bundle delta +5.2 KB gzip under the +6 KB budget.
- Code-reviewer returned REQUEST_CHANGES with 4 blockers (B1 single-clip-pool video churn, B2 stale rvfc tick, B3 duplicated persistSession, B4 missing call-site wire tests). All blockers applied; regression tests added.
- `verify-phase6-3.mjs` C1–C4 PASS, console_errors=0.
